    "Require one successor and exactly one canonical persistent format for PR469/PR470.",
    "Preserve common Node/Client storage, offline/restart, Owner REST, secure Origin, normal file access and full-tree export.",
    "Require lossless states, migration/roundtrip/negative tests and fresh successor HEAD/TREE evidence."
  ],
  "artificial_cognitive_contributions": [
    "Observe exact candidates and main; three-way reconcile their overlapping sources.",
    "Select existing SQLite as canonical, reduce QIKMESH1 to immutable byte-exact transport with no runtime writer.",
    "Extend existing builder/importer/listener/React viewer/Origin validator, preserving original native sources.",
    "Add virtual full-tree table, Git-free source identity verification, stopped-writer export, independent pins and create-only validated import.",
    "Add actual REST pending/effect/replay/SIGKILL roundtrip, full-tree original EOL/mode/Unicode/symlink and corruption/authority tests."
  ],
